{"seconds": 17.6, "exit": 0, "final": "**Coaching Note:**\n\nWhen your opponent's king moves to the rim (h6 here), look for forcing checks that drive it further into the open. Qg7+ forces Kh5, and then Qxh7# is checkmate. The key: exposed kings have limited escape squares. Push them to the edge, then deliver mate.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Qg7+\", \"line\": [\"Qg7+\", \"Kh5\", \"Qxh7#\"], \"motifs\": [\"attraction\", \"mate\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2b1p/4N1pk/3P1p2/1RP5/p1QKP2P/5qP1/8 w - - 2 38"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2b1p/4N1pk/3P1p2/1RP5/p1QKP2P/5qP1/8 w - - 2 38"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2b1p/4N1pk/3P1p2/1RP5/p1QKP2P/5qP1/8 w - - 2 38"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2b1p/4N1pk/3P1p2/1RP5/p1QKP2P/5qP1/8 w - - 2 38", "move": "Qg7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2bQp/4N1pk/3P1p2/1RP5/p2KP2P/5qP1/8 b - - 3 38", "move": "Kh5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2bQp/4N1pk/3P1p2/1RP5/p2KP2P/5qP1/8 b - - 3 38"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r7/2n2bQp/4N1p1/3P1p1k/1RP5/p2KP2P/5qP1/8 w - - 4 39", "move": "Qxh7"}}], "aiu": 2.49934, "violations": [], "id": "0MEVb"}